    {
      "body": "Right, it was skipped on CPU CI. Fixed in 18ae4a6: the class now uses gloo, bypasses the device-count gate like the AutoTP gloo checkpoint test and builds CPU tensors; without LOCAL_SIZE it runs, fails on master and passes with the fix.",
