      "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n## Copilot review overview\n\n### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThe regression test does not configure the claimed CPU/Gloo environment and may be skipped or run with another backend.\n\n**Review effort:** Balanced  \n**Findings:** 1 <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture>\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>Open (1)</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Configure the test to explicitly run the CPU/Gloo backend](#discussion_r4171606795) · New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nCorrects ZeRO++ qgZ gradient averaging across all ranks.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Divides reduced gradients by global world size.\n- Adds a four-rank regression test.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `deepspeed/​runtime/​comm/​coalesced_collectives.py` | Fixes qgZ averaging. |\r\n| `tests/​unit/​runtime/​comm/​test_coalesced_collectives.py` | Tests two-stage reduction scaling. |\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/new/master?filename=.github/skills